CreatePsDec supports a reset an open instance path. If any later
step fails, control jumps to bail.

This commit fixes the UAF by deleting only locally-allocated buffers
inside CreatePsDec and explicitly calling DeletePsDec() in the caller
sbrDecoder_ResetElement if CreatePsDec fails. DeletePsDec() will reclaim
the space and clear the handle.

